{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01E84wvYxN1ZQ2NPPjGm8KV3", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/jmbr/article/download/271840/187924/1244842\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.pptvhd36.com/news/%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%9F%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%AA%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%8C/190408\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thairath.co.th/lifestyle/life/967928\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thairath.co.th/lifestyle/culture/2947731\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so01.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/crrugds_ejournal/article/download/152420/111242/411725\"}, {\"url\": \"https://digital.car.chula.ac.th/chulaetd/20233\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=140646\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.dailynews.co.th/articles/4995287/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so02.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/clcjn/article/download/269594/180624/1134976\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:59:23.342Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"(โบ) ผีเรือน\" OR \"ผีเรือน (โบ)\" พจนานุกรม", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01PJuN67qAHTCaAJtQeDwJDo", "content": [{"title": "so03.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/jmbr/article/download/271840/187924/1244842"}, {"title": "Top-WorldKickoff Top-WorldKickoff", "url": "https://www.pptvhd36.com/news/%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%9F%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%AA%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%8C/190408"}, {"title": "www.thairath.co.th", "url": "https://www.thairath.co.th/lifestyle/life/967928"}, {"title": "www.thairath.co.th", "url": "https://www.thairath.co.th/lifestyle/culture/2947731"}, {"title": "so01.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so01.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/crrugds_ejournal/article/download/152420/111242/411725"}, {"title": "Chulalongkorn University Theses and Dissertations (Chula ETD)", "url": "https://digital.car.chula.ac.th/chulaetd/20233"}, {"title": "“ผี” เป็นอะไรได้บ้าง? ค้นความหมายอันหลายหลากของผี จากเอกสารโบราณ", "url": "https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=140646"}, {"title": "www.dailynews.co.th", "url": "https://www.dailynews.co.th/articles/4995287/"}, {"title": "so02.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so02.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/clcjn/article/download/269594/180624/1134976"}]}, "I couldn't find a dictionary entry for \"(โบ) ผีเรือน\" in these results. None of the pages quote a Royal Institute entry under that headword, and I didn't find an explanation of what the \"(โบ)\" marker means.\n\nThe closest material is about \"ผี\" in general and household spirits:\n\n- A Royal Institute-style definition of ผี, as quoted in a Thai academic article, describes it as something people believe in that is mysterious and unseen but can appear to have a form, and that can bring good or harm. (so03.tci-thaijo.org, index 1-1)\n- A Thairath article describes \"ไหว้ผีบ้านผีเรือน\", the practice of honoring household spirits, especially during New Year, Songkran, and Sarot festivals. (www.thairath.co.th, index 4-1)\n- A Silpa Magazine article notes that the meaning of ผี in older Thai texts was broader than today's, covering uses such as a corpse. (www.silpa-mag.com, index 7-2)\n\nTo find the entry itself, I'd suggest searching the Royal Institute's online dictionary (lexitron or the rirs3 site) directly for ผีเรือน. Its abbreviation list should explain what \"(โบ)\" means, probably \"archaic\" or \"old usage,\" but I haven't confirmed that."], "durationSeconds": 6.092711416000002, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01E84wvYxN1ZQ2NPPjGm8KV3", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
